they are","transliteration":"kānū"},{"position":8,"text":"صَٰدِقِينَ","translation":"truthful","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna"}]},{"id":5313,"verseKey":"68:42","verseNumber":42,"arabic":"يَوۡمَ يُكۡشَفُ عَن سَاقٖ وَيُدۡعَوۡنَ إِلَى ٱلسُّجُودِ فَلَا يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ","translation":"The Day the shin will be uncovered and they are invited to prostration but they [i.e., the disbelievers] will not be able,","transliteration":"yawma yuk'shafu ʿan sāqin wayud'ʿawna ilā l-sujūdi falā yastaṭīʿūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/068042.mp3","segments":[[0,1,40,610],[1,2,620,1330],[2,3,1340,2300],[3,4,2310,3190],[4,5,3200,4770],[5,6,4780,5120],[6,7,5130,6100],[7,8,6110,6680],[8,9,6690,9810]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"يَوۡمَ","translation":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma"},{"position":2,"text":"يُكۡشَفُ","translation":"will be uncovered","transliteration":"yuk'shafu"},{"position":3,"text":"عَن","translation":"from","transliteration":"ʿan"},{"position":4,"text":"سَاقٖ","translation":"the shin","transliteration":"sāqin"},{"position":5,"text":"وَيُدۡعَوۡنَ","translation":"and they will be called","transliteration":"wayud'ʿawna"},{"position":6,"text":"إِلَى","translation":"to","transliteration":"ilā"},{"position":7,"text":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","translation":"prostrate","transliteration":"l-sujūdi"},{"position":8,"text":"فَلَا","translation":"but not","transliteration":"falā"},{"position":9,"text":"يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ","translation":"they will be able","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna"}]},{"id":5314,"verseKey":"68:43","verseNumber":43,"arabic":"خَٰشِعَةً أَبۡصَٰرُهُمۡ تَرۡهَقُهُمۡ ذِلَّةٞۖ وَقَدۡ كَانُواْ يُدۡعَوۡنَ إِلَى ٱلسُّجُودِ وَهُمۡ سَٰلِمُونَ","translation":"Their eyes humbled, humiliation will cover them. And they used to be invited to prostration while they were sound.","transliteration":"khāshiʿatan abṣāruhum tarhaquhum dhillatun waqad kānū yud'ʿawna ilā l-sujūdi wahum sālimūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/068043.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,1240],[1,2,1250,2560],[2,3,2570,3800],[3,4,3810,5130],[4,5,5140,5670],[5,6,5680,6480],[6,7,6490,7480],[7,8,7490,7840],[8,9,7850,8870],[9,10,8880,9360],[10,11,9370,12370]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"خَٰشِعَةً","translation":"Humbled","transliteration":"khāshiʿatan"},{"position":2,"text":"أَبۡصَٰرُهُمۡ","translation":"their eyes","transliteration":"abṣāruhum"},{"position":3,"text":"تَرۡهَقُهُمۡ","translation":"will cover them","transliteration":"tarhaquhum"},{"position":4,"text":"ذِلَّةٞۖ","translation":"humiliation","transliteration":"dhillatun"},{"position":5,"text":"وَقَدۡ","translation":"And indeed","transliteration":"waqad"},{"position":6,"text":"كَانُواْ","translation":"they were","transliteration":"kānū"},{"position":7,"text":"يُدۡعَوۡنَ","translation":"called","transliteration":"yud'ʿawna"},{"position":8,"text":"إِلَى","translation":"to","transliteration":"ilā"},{"position":9,"text":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","translation":"prostrate","transliteration":"l-sujūdi"},{"position":10,"text":"وَهُمۡ","translation":"while they","transliteration":"wahum"},{"position":11,"text":"سَٰلِمُونَ","translation":"(were) sound","transliteration":"sālimūna"}]},{"id":5315,"verseKey":"68:44","verseNumber":44,"arabic":"فَذَرۡنِي وَمَن يُكَذِّبُ بِهَٰذَا ٱلۡحَدِيثِۖ سَنَسۡتَدۡرِجُهُم مِّنۡ حَيۡثُ لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation":"So leave Me, [O Muḥammad], with [the matter of] whoever denies this statement [i.e., the Qur’ān]. We will progressively lead them [to punishment] from where they do not know.","transliteration":"fadharnī waman yukadhibu bihādhā l-ḥadīthi sanastadrijuhum min ḥaythu lā yaʿlamūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/068044.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,920],[1,2,930,2380],[2,3,2390,3140],[3,4,3150,3920],[4,5,3930,6830],[5,6,6840,9340],[6,7,9350,9570],[7,8,9580,10250],[8,9,10260,10610],[9,10,10620,13480]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"فَذَرۡنِي","translation":"So leave Me","transliteration":"fadharnī"},{"position":2,"text":"وَمَن","translation":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman"},{"position":3,"text":"يُكَذِّبُ","translation":"denies","transliteration":"yukadhibu"},{"position":4,"text":"بِهَٰذَا","translation":"this","transliteration":"bihādhā"},{"position":5,"text":"ٱلۡحَدِيثِۖ","translation":"Statement","transliteration":"l-ḥadīthi"},{"position":6,"text":"سَنَسۡتَدۡرِجُهُم","translation":"We will progressively lead them","transliteration":"sanastadrijuhum"},{"position":7,"text":"مِّنۡ","translation":"from","transliteration":"min"},{"position":8,"text":"حَيۡثُ","translation":"where","transliteration":"ḥaythu"},{"position":9,"text":"لَا","translation":"not","transliteration":"lā"},{"position":10,"text":"يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation":"they know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna"}]},{"id":5316,"verseKey":"68:45","verseNumber":45,"arabic":"وَأُمۡلِي لَهُمۡۚ إِنَّ كَيۡدِي مَتِينٌ","translation":"And I will give them time. Indeed, My plan is firm.","transliteration":"wa-um'lī lahum inna kaydī matīnun","audioUrl":"/audio/7/068045.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,980],[1,2,990,2000],[2,3,2010,3180],[3,4,3190,4020],[4,5,4030,6310]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَأُمۡلِي","translation":"And I will give respite","transliteration":"wa-um'lī"},{"position":2,"text":"لَهُمۡۚ","translation":"to them","transliteration":"lahum"},{"position":3,"text":"إِنَّ","translation":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna"},{"position":4,"text":"كَيۡدِي","translation":"My plan","transliteration":"kaydī"},{"position":5,"text":"مَتِينٌ","translation":"(is) firm","transliteration":"matīnun"}]},{"id":5317,"verseKey":"68:46","verseNumber":46,"arabic":"أَمۡ تَسۡـَٔلُهُمۡ أَجۡرٗا فَهُم مِّن مَّغۡرَمٖ مُّثۡقَلُونَ","translation":"Or do you ask of them a payment, so they are by debt burdened down?","transliteration":"am tasaluhum ajran fahum min maghramin muth'qalūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/068046.mp3","segments":[[0,1,30,340],[1,2,350,1470],[2,3,1480,2850],[3,4,2860,4350],[4,5,4360,5230],[5,6,5240,6780],[6,7,6790,9550]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"أَمۡ","translation":"Or","transliteration":"am"},{"position":2,"text":"تَسۡـَٔلُهُمۡ","translation":"you ask them","t